@host = http://localhost:8080

### Portfolio del usuario de ejemplo
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/1/portfolio

### Buscar por ticker
GET {{host}}/api/v1/instruments/search?q=PAMP

### Buscar por nombre
GET {{host}}/api/v1/instruments/search?q=banco

### Compra a mercado por cantidad
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 1
}

### Compra a mercado por monto
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "amount": 2000
}

### Compra limite
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instrumentId": 1,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "size": 1,
  "price": 100
}

### Cancelar una orden NEW (id 5 en el seed)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users/1/orders/5/cancel
